<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <style>
        {{{inlineResetStyles}}}
        {{{inlineStyles}}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="text--right txt txt--xs">PC-G-17.0C (Rev. 5-2019)</div>
            <div class="text--center">
                <h2 class="mt-16 uppercase">PROBATE COURT OF FRANKLIN COUNTY, OHIO</h2>
                <h4 class="uppercase">JEFFREY D. MACKEY, JUDGE</h4>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>IN THE MATTER OF THE GUARDIANSHIP OF</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{caseDetailsStep.guardianName}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--center mt-16">
                <h2>ADULT GUARDIANSHIP SERVICE INFORMATION</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="text--left mt-4">
                <div class="txt txt--s fw-600">
                    <p>Ohio law requires that the person for whom appointment is sought be visited and personally served notice of the guardianship application by the probate court investigator at least seven days prior to the scheduled hearing date.<br> The following information is needed to ensure the safety of our court investigators and ensure the Court’s ability to timely notify the Prospective Ward as required by Ohio law. [Please fill out this form completely]</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-16 grid gap-16">
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>1. At the time of the filing of the application for guardianship, the Prospective Ward is physically at:</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Street Address:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{wardLocationStep.streetAddress}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">City, State Zip Code</div>
                    <div class="input w-55">{{wardLocationStep.city}}, {{wardLocationStep.state}}, {{wardLocationStep.zip}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Telephone Number:</div>
                    <div class="input mw-200">{{wardLocationStep.wardPhone}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>2. Does the Prospective Ward leave the above location on a regular basis (school, work, vacation, etc.) during the day?</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="left w-auto flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                      <div class="checkbox"></div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s">Yes{{#ifEquals safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardLeaveDuringDay.answer true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                      <div class="checkbox ml-10">{{#ifEquals safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardLeaveDuringDay.answer false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s">No</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s ml-10">If yes, explain:</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{#if safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardLeaveDuringDay.explanation}}
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardLeaveDuringDay.explanation}}</div>
                  </div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardLeaveDuringDay.explanation}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>3. Is there a situation or special circumstance of which the investigator should be aware such as weapons in the home,</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="left w-auto flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                      <div class="txt txt--s">
                        <p>dangerous situations, contagious diseases, etc.? </p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="checkbox ml-10">{{#ifEquals safetyServiceStep.specialCircumstances.answer true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s">Yes</div>
                      <div class="checkbox ml-10">{{#ifEquals safetyServiceStep.specialCircumstances.answer false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s">No</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s ml-10">If yes, explain:</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{#if safetyServiceStep.specialCircumstances.explanation}}
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{safetyServiceStep.specialCircumstances.explanation}}</div>
                  </div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{safetyServiceStep.specialCircumstances.explanation}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>4. Does the Prospective Ward speak a foreign language or have any medical issues or other communication issues</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="left w-auto flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                      <div class="txt txt--s">
                        <p>which would prevent them from communicating with the investigator?</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="checkbox ml-10">{{#ifEquals safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardHasCommunicationIssues.answer true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s">Yes</div>
                      <div class="checkbox ml-10">{{#ifEquals safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardHasCommunicationIssues.answer false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s">No</div>
                      <div class="txt txt--s ml-10">If yes, explain:</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{#if safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardHasCommunicationIssues.explanation}}
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardHasCommunicationIssues.explanation}}</div>
                  </div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{safetyServiceStep.isProspectiveWardHasCommunicationIssues.explanation}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex pl-16 v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="txt txt--s mt-10">
              <p>The Applicant is responsible for providing the name and phone number of someone (which may be the Applicant) who may be contacted by the court investigator during regular business hours (8:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m.) if assistance is required to complete service.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex v--end h--between mt-8 gap-4">
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Contact Person’s Name:</div>
              <div class="input w-55">{{caseDetailsStep.contactName}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Telephone Number:</div>
              <div class="input mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.contactPhone}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--left mt-10">
                <div class="txt txt--s fw-600">
                    <p>CAUTION: The hearing will not occur unless the visit is completed at least seven days prior to the scheduled hearing date, unless otherwise approved by the court. If there is a change in the location of the Prospective Ward between the time the application is filed and the hearing date, it is the Applicant’s responsibility to notify the court investigator at (614) 525-6109 or (614) 525-6296.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-16 grid col-2 gap-20">
                <div class="col">
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4">Attorney/Applicant Signature</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--between">
              <div class="txt txt--s">15.8</div>
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--s uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-17.0C - ADULT GUARDIANSHIP INFORMATION
              </div>
              <div class="txt txt--s pr-20"></div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>